WEBVTT

00:02.509 --> 00:03.885
KATARA: Water.

00:04.886 --> 00:06.054
Earth.

00:06.846 --> 00:08.139
Fire.

00:08.890 --> 00:10.183
Air.

00:11.017 --> 00:14.979
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.480 --> 00:18.733
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.692 --> 00:22.529
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.612 --> 00:23.821
could stop them.

00:23.905 --> 00:26.658
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:27.158 --> 00:29.744
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

00:29.827 --> 00:32.664
the new Avatar,
an Airbender named Aang.

00:32.914 --> 00:35.041
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.124 --> 00:37.710
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.794 --> 00:38.920
AANG: Oof!

00:39.003 --> 00:41.965
KATARA: But I believe
Aang can save the world.

00:57.400 --> 00:59.778
( ZUKO YAWNING )

01:00.654 --> 01:01.863
What's that smell?

01:02.697 --> 01:06.201
It's jook. I'm sure
you wouldn't like it.

01:07.327 --> 01:08.870
( INHALING )

01:08.954 --> 01:12.707
Actually, it smells delicious.
I'd love a bowl, Uncle.

01:14.542 --> 01:18.755
Now that your fever is gone,
you seem different somehow.

01:19.422 --> 01:21.132
It's a new day.

01:21.258 --> 01:23.218
We've got a new apartment,
new furniture,

01:23.343 --> 01:26.012
and today's the grand opening
of your new tea shop.

01:26.137 --> 01:29.140
Things are looking up, Uncle.
( SIPPING )

01:33.603 --> 01:35.689
You haven't seen your
Dad in over two years.

01:35.855 --> 01:37.232
You must be so excited.

01:37.315 --> 01:38.483
( RETCHES )

01:38.566 --> 01:41.861
I know I should be, but I just
feel sick to my stomach.

01:42.404 --> 01:45.699
Don't be nervous, he's gonna
be so happy to see you.

01:45.824 --> 01:46.908
So what about you?

01:47.033 --> 01:48.618
Are you nervous
to meet this Guru?

01:48.702 --> 01:49.953
Not at all.

01:50.036 --> 01:51.830
I'm ready to master
the Avatar State.

01:51.955 --> 01:53.456
I'll do whatever it takes.

01:55.750 --> 01:57.002
See you in a week.

01:57.127 --> 01:58.628
Yip! Yip!

02:01.423 --> 02:03.049
( SIGHS HEAVILY )

02:14.269 --> 02:17.063
- Sokka, good to see you.
-( WARRIORS LAUGHING )

02:36.082 --> 02:37.250
Sokka.

02:38.126 --> 02:39.336
Hi, Dad.

02:46.217 --> 02:47.677
Look, Bosco,

02:47.761 --> 02:50.972
the Kyoshi Warriors
are here to protect us.

02:51.097 --> 02:52.891
Aren't you excited?

02:53.016 --> 02:54.809
( YAWNING )

02:54.934 --> 02:56.644
It's been a difficult
week for me.

02:56.770 --> 02:59.731
My most trusted advisor,
Long Feng, and his Dai Li agents

02:59.814 --> 03:02.275
tried to take control
of Ba Sing Se from me.

03:02.567 --> 03:05.820
It's terrible when you can't trust
the people who are closest to you.

03:06.029 --> 03:07.739
But there is good news.

03:07.864 --> 03:11.493
As we speak, the Council of Five
is meeting to plan an invasion

03:11.618 --> 03:15.872
of The Fire Nation this summer―
On the day of a solar eclipse.

03:15.997 --> 03:17.540
Really?

03:17.665 --> 03:21.252
Now that sounds like
a fascinating and brilliant plan.

03:26.591 --> 03:27.801
General Fong's base

03:27.926 --> 03:30.387
will serve as the launching
point for the attack.

03:30.512 --> 03:34.057
In exactly two months,
the Army and Navy will invade

03:34.182 --> 03:37.143
the Fire Nation
on The Day of Black Sun.

03:37.894 --> 03:40.855
Or we could send in
Momo to do some damage.

03:40.980 --> 03:43.191
( LAUGHING ) 'Cause the...

03:43.316 --> 03:44.651
Sorry.

03:46.528 --> 03:47.779
( SCREECHING )

03:48.405 --> 03:50.323
All we need is
the Earth King's seal

03:50.407 --> 03:52.075
in order to execute
the plan.

03:54.577 --> 03:56.496
I'll get these scrolls
to him right away.

03:56.579 --> 03:58.248
Thank you, General How.

03:59.416 --> 04:01.126
( APPA GRUNTING )

04:15.598 --> 04:17.434
Um, hello?

04:19.394 --> 04:21.146
You're Guru Pathik, right?

04:21.396 --> 04:23.648
The person who attached
the note to Appa's horn?

04:23.898 --> 04:25.108
Indeed.

04:25.191 --> 04:27.652
I was a spiritual brother
of your people,

04:27.735 --> 04:30.321
and a personal friend
of Monk Gyatso.

04:31.281 --> 04:33.241
In your note, you said
you could teach me

04:33.366 --> 04:35.326
to gain control
of the Avatar State.

04:35.410 --> 04:36.536
How?

04:36.619 --> 04:39.456
You must gain balance
within yourself

04:39.539 --> 04:42.292
before you can bring
balance to the world.

04:42.417 --> 04:45.795
And the first step to gaining
balance begins with this.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.172
Drink up.

04:48.923 --> 04:50.300
( SIPPING, SPITTING )

04:50.383 --> 04:51.509
Ugh!

04:51.593 --> 04:53.887
It tastes like onion
and banana juice!

04:54.512 --> 04:56.014
That's because it is.

04:56.139 --> 04:58.141
( SLURPING ) Yum! Yum!

05:02.061 --> 05:04.147
I believe we need to go right!

05:04.230 --> 05:05.565
What are you talking about?

05:05.690 --> 05:07.692
The Bei Fong Estate's this way.

05:07.817 --> 05:09.736
I'm quite certain
you're mistaken.

05:09.819 --> 05:11.029
( LOUD BANGING )

05:11.112 --> 05:13.990
Hey, can you two old ladies quit
your bickering for a second?

05:14.073 --> 05:15.950
I gotta go to the bathroom!

05:16.159 --> 05:18.244
Oh... Uh...

05:18.369 --> 05:20.538
Okay, but make it quick.

05:20.997 --> 05:22.957
What's wrong with you?!

05:23.041 --> 05:25.793
Oh, very sneaky, Toph!

05:26.127 --> 05:29.172
Nice try,
but you can't trick me.

05:29.714 --> 05:32.592
Let me outta here,
so I can kick both your butts!

05:32.717 --> 05:34.469
Quit your banging!

05:34.594 --> 05:37.305
You might think you're
the greatest Earthbender

05:37.388 --> 05:40.308
in the world,
but even you can't bend metal.

05:50.151 --> 05:53.780
We've been presented with
an extraordinary opportunity, girls.

05:53.905 --> 05:57.075
Mai finally gets to wear makeup
that's not totally depressing?

05:57.200 --> 05:58.743
Ha. Ha.

05:58.868 --> 06:03.289
I'm talking about conquering
the whole Earth Kingdom.

06:03.414 --> 06:06.292
For a hundred years
the Fire Nation has hammered away

06:06.376 --> 06:08.920
at Ba Sing Se from the outside.

06:09.003 --> 06:13.633
But now we are on the inside,
and we can take it by ourselves.

06:13.967 --> 06:17.887
Gosh, you're so confident.
I really admire that about you.

06:18.304 --> 06:20.473
From the inside,
we're in the perfect position

06:20.598 --> 06:23.476
to organize a coup
and overthrow the Earth King.

06:23.601 --> 06:25.937
The key is the Dai Li.

06:26.062 --> 06:29.566
Whoever controls the Dai Li,
controls Ba Sing Se.

06:34.571 --> 06:37.240
In order to master the Avatar State,

06:37.365 --> 06:40.159
you must open all the chakras.

06:40.702 --> 06:43.955
Aang, tell me everything
you know about chakras.

06:44.414 --> 06:45.999
What are chakras?

06:46.624 --> 06:48.376
Oh, I see.

06:48.501 --> 06:50.712
I guess we'll start
with the basics.

06:51.796 --> 06:53.590
The water flows
through this creek

06:53.673 --> 06:56.759
much like the energy flows
through your body.

06:57.176 --> 06:58.928
As you see,
there are several pools

06:59.012 --> 07:01.848
where the water swirls
around before flowing on.

07:02.265 --> 07:05.059
These pools are
like our chakras.

07:05.476 --> 07:08.813
So, chakras are pools
of spiraling energy in our bodies?

07:09.063 --> 07:12.442
Exactly. If nothing else were around,

07:12.567 --> 07:15.236
this creek would
flow pure and clear.

07:15.361 --> 07:17.363
However, life is messy,

07:17.447 --> 07:19.449
and things tend
to fall in the creek,

07:19.532 --> 07:21.618
and then what happens?

07:21.909 --> 07:24.203
- The creek can't flow?
- Yes.

07:24.579 --> 07:28.124
But if we open the paths
between the pools...

07:28.207 --> 07:29.834
The energy flows!

07:29.917 --> 07:32.128
( WATER GURGLING )

07:35.423 --> 07:38.217
There are seven chakras
that go up the body.

07:38.343 --> 07:40.637
Each pool of energy
has a purpose,

07:40.720 --> 07:44.265
and can be blocked by a
specific kind of emotional muck.

07:44.682 --> 07:49.228
Be warned― Opening the chakras
is an intense experience,

07:49.354 --> 07:51.272
and once you begin
this process,

07:51.397 --> 07:54.984
you cannot stop until
all seven are open.

07:55.109 --> 07:56.569
Are you ready?

07:58.655 --> 08:00.156
I'll do whatever it takes.

08:00.657 --> 08:03.242
First we will open the Earth chakra,

08:03.368 --> 08:05.495
located at the base
of the spine.

08:05.787 --> 08:09.332
It deals with survival
and is blocked by fear.

08:09.957 --> 08:11.793
What are you most afraid of?

08:13.086 --> 08:15.463
Let your fears
become clear to you.

08:18.383 --> 08:20.635
( SCREAMING )

08:27.600 --> 08:29.268
( SCREAMING )

08:29.352 --> 08:32.689
GURU: Aang, your vision is not real.

08:32.980 --> 08:35.149
You are concerned
for your survival,

08:35.233 --> 08:37.652
but you must surrender
those fears.

08:37.944 --> 08:41.280
Let your fears
flow down the creek.

08:45.201 --> 08:47.578
You have opened
your Earth chakra.

08:48.329 --> 08:49.497
Whew.

08:51.416 --> 08:53.876
( WATER CASCADING )

08:57.547 --> 09:00.049
- Next is the...
- Water chakra?

09:00.133 --> 09:01.300
Brilliant!

09:01.384 --> 09:04.011
Maybe one day you
will be a Guru, too.

09:04.929 --> 09:09.726
This chakra deals with pleasure,
and is blocked by guilt.

09:09.934 --> 09:14.480
Now, look at all the guilt
which burdens you so.

09:15.231 --> 09:17.734
What do you blame
yourself for?

09:21.863 --> 09:23.406
AANG: I ran away.

09:34.250 --> 09:35.835
I hurt all of those people.

09:36.502 --> 09:40.298
Accept the reality
that these things happened,

09:40.423 --> 09:44.218
but do not let them cloud
and poison your energy.

09:44.761 --> 09:48.014
If you are to be a positive
influence on the world,

09:48.139 --> 09:50.933
you need to
forgive yourself.

09:56.564 --> 09:59.817
CHIEF HAKODA: This bay leads directly
to the outskirts of Ba Sing Se.

10:00.610 --> 10:02.278
We've been using
these tangle mines

10:02.403 --> 10:05.031
to stop the Fire Nation
ships from getting through.

10:05.573 --> 10:08.534
Your father invented
tangle mines, himself.

10:09.535 --> 10:12.079
Destructive, buoyant, and...

10:12.163 --> 10:13.164
( SNIFFING )

10:13.247 --> 10:14.665
( GASPS )

10:15.082 --> 10:16.542
...terrible smelling!

10:16.667 --> 10:17.960
Very perceptive.

10:18.085 --> 10:21.047
The mines are filled with
skunk-fish and seaweed.

10:21.130 --> 10:23.049
When a ship
detonates the mine,

10:23.132 --> 10:25.343
the seaweed tangles
up the propeller,

10:25.426 --> 10:29.347
and the foul smell forces
people to abandon the ship.

10:29.430 --> 10:32.308
I call it
the stink n' sink.

10:32.391 --> 10:35.520
( LAUGHING ) Good one, Dad!

10:35.603 --> 10:37.772
You are definitely
your father's son.

10:38.564 --> 10:41.901
Hakoda, our scouts have
spotted four Fire Nation ships.

10:42.318 --> 10:44.320
Bato, get these mines loaded up.

10:44.403 --> 10:46.864
The rest of you men,
prepare for battle.

10:49.075 --> 10:51.035
Um, what should I do, Dad?

10:51.327 --> 10:52.578
Aren't you listening?

10:52.662 --> 10:55.206
I said the rest of you men
get ready for battle.

11:04.340 --> 11:07.677
Who thought when we came
to this city as refugees,

11:07.802 --> 11:11.180
that I'd end up
owning my own tea shop.

11:11.264 --> 11:15.810
Follow your passion, Zuko,
and life will reward you.

11:16.269 --> 11:18.062
Congratulations, Uncle.

11:18.145 --> 11:19.814
I'm very thankful.

11:20.273 --> 11:21.732
You deserve it.

11:21.816 --> 11:24.610
The Jasmine Dragon will be
the best tea shop in the city.

11:25.069 --> 11:27.947
No, I'm thankful
because you decided

11:28.030 --> 11:30.658
to share this special
day with me.

11:30.741 --> 11:33.327
It means more
than you know.

11:35.288 --> 11:37.123
Now let's make these
people some tea.

11:39.083 --> 11:42.545
Yes, let's make some tea!

11:46.549 --> 11:50.094
Third is the Fire chakra,
located in the stomach.

11:50.720 --> 11:52.763
My Fire chakra would
like to eat something

11:52.847 --> 11:54.348
other than onion-banana juice.

11:54.432 --> 11:55.641
( CHUCKLING )

11:55.725 --> 11:57.685
Good one. Moving on.

11:58.728 --> 12:03.482
This chakra deals with will power
and is blocked by shame.

12:03.608 --> 12:05.192
What are you ashamed of?

12:06.611 --> 12:09.655
What are your biggest
disappointments in yourself?

12:13.910 --> 12:16.078
I'm never gonna firebend again.

12:16.203 --> 12:17.538
I can't.

12:17.663 --> 12:19.457
You will never find balance,

12:19.582 --> 12:22.001
if you deny this part of your life.

12:22.710 --> 12:24.420
You are the Avatar,

12:24.503 --> 12:27.673
and therefore,
you are a Firebender.

12:28.507 --> 12:31.385
( INHALES, EXHALES )

12:33.054 --> 12:36.933
Hmm, that chakra opened
less like a flowing creek,

12:37.016 --> 12:38.434
and more like a...

12:38.726 --> 12:40.144
Burping bison.

12:40.227 --> 12:41.646
( BELCHES )

12:42.396 --> 12:47.026
Tastes like onions and bananas,
but, strangely, something else.

12:47.151 --> 12:48.653
Pickles?

12:49.278 --> 12:50.363
( SHRUGS )

12:55.493 --> 12:58.537
I'm tired of wearing
this girly disguise.

12:58.621 --> 13:00.748
I don't know how anyone
can fight in this.

13:00.831 --> 13:02.416
Maybe that's why
it was so easy

13:02.500 --> 13:05.378
to beat the Kyoshi Warriors
and take their clothes.

13:06.379 --> 13:08.923
How much longer do we have
to serve the Earth King?

13:09.006 --> 13:11.300
If I have to clean up one
more pile of bear poop,

13:11.384 --> 13:12.551
I'm gonna throw up.

13:13.177 --> 13:16.013
Princess Azula promised we
would go back to the Fire Nation

13:16.138 --> 13:18.140
as soon as we captured
the Avatar.

13:18.224 --> 13:20.518
- We just have to be patient.
- Shush up!

13:21.060 --> 13:23.646
Do you want the whole palace
to know we're Fire Nation?

13:24.105 --> 13:25.439
Sorry.

13:33.823 --> 13:35.199
Good work, girls.

13:35.324 --> 13:37.994
I am sure the Dai Li
will deliver the message.

13:40.079 --> 13:43.124
The fourth chakra
is located in the heart.

13:43.249 --> 13:47.211
It deals with love,
and is blocked by grief.

13:48.838 --> 13:51.590
Lay all your grief
out in front of you.

14:16.323 --> 14:20.286
GURU: You have, indeed, felt a great loss.

14:20.411 --> 14:27.251
But love is a form of energy,
and it swirls all around us.

14:27.376 --> 14:31.380
The Air Nomads' love for you
has not left this world.

14:31.505 --> 14:34.383
It is still inside of your heart,

14:34.508 --> 14:38.054
and is reborn in
the form of new love.

14:41.766 --> 14:44.101
Let the pain flow away.

14:46.145 --> 14:47.646
Very good.

14:49.065 --> 14:51.650
Can I have some
onion-banana juice, please?

14:53.819 --> 14:56.822
The fifth in the chain
is the Sound chakra,

14:56.906 --> 14:58.574
located in the throat.

14:59.158 --> 15:03.370
It deals with truth,
and is blocked by lies―

15:03.454 --> 15:05.498
The ones we tell ourselves.

15:06.165 --> 15:08.751
Why didn't you tell
us you were the Avatar?

15:09.376 --> 15:10.795
Because I never wanted to be.

15:11.295 --> 15:14.507
You cannot lie about your own nature.

15:14.632 --> 15:18.135
You must accept that
you are the Avatar.

15:18.260 --> 15:20.221
( INHALING, EXHALING )

15:30.314 --> 15:32.149
Very good, Aang.

15:32.233 --> 15:35.319
You have opened the chakra of Truth.

15:37.363 --> 15:40.741
The sixth pool of energy
is the Light chakra,

15:40.825 --> 15:43.702
located in the center
of the forehead.

15:44.078 --> 15:48.749
It deals with insight
and is blocked by illusion.

15:48.874 --> 15:51.252
The greatest illusion of this world

15:51.377 --> 15:54.171
is the illusion of separation.

15:54.296 --> 15:56.715
Things you think are
separate and different

15:56.799 --> 15:59.468
are actually one
and the same.

15:59.677 --> 16:01.512
AANG: Like the four nations.

16:01.595 --> 16:07.476
GURU: Yes, we are all one people,
but we live as if divided.

16:08.018 --> 16:09.687
We're all connected.

16:09.812 --> 16:11.605
Everything is connected.

16:11.730 --> 16:13.107
That's right.

16:13.232 --> 16:17.528
Even the separation
of the four elements is an illusion.

16:17.653 --> 16:19.238
If you open your mind,

16:19.363 --> 16:22.199
you will see that all
the elements are one―

16:22.283 --> 16:24.910
Four parts of the same whole.

16:24.994 --> 16:27.955
Even metal is just a part of Earth

16:28.080 --> 16:30.916
that has been purified and refined.

16:33.460 --> 16:35.796
( INHALES, EXHALES )

16:38.716 --> 16:42.928
( STRAINING ) Come on metal... Budge.

16:43.179 --> 16:44.180
( METAL THUDS )

16:44.555 --> 16:46.891
Woo! Toph, you rule!

16:51.520 --> 16:52.605
What do you say, Momo?

16:52.688 --> 16:54.773
A cup of tea before
we get back to the king?

16:54.857 --> 16:56.400
( CHATTERING )

16:58.611 --> 16:59.987
Table for two, please.

17:00.529 --> 17:04.283
Uncle, I need two jasmine,
one green and one lychee.

17:04.408 --> 17:06.785
I'm brewing as fast as I can.

17:18.047 --> 17:19.965
AANG: This is the last chakra, isn't it?

17:20.049 --> 17:21.467
GURU: Yes.

17:21.550 --> 17:23.302
Once you open this chakra,

17:23.385 --> 17:27.139
you will be able go in and out
of the Avatar State at will.

17:27.223 --> 17:29.266
And when you are in
the Avatar State,

17:29.350 --> 17:31.185
you will have
complete control

17:31.268 --> 17:34.313
and awareness
of all your actions.

17:34.647 --> 17:36.023
Let's do this.

17:36.148 --> 17:40.361
The Thought chakra is located
at the crown of the head.

17:40.486 --> 17:43.530
It deals with pure cosmic energy

17:43.614 --> 17:46.617
and is blocked by earthly attachment.

17:46.742 --> 17:50.496
Meditate on what attaches
you to this world.

17:56.752 --> 18:01.006
Now, let all of those attachments go.

18:01.090 --> 18:03.801
Let them flow down the river...

18:03.884 --> 18:04.969
Forgotten.

18:05.552 --> 18:07.972
What? Why would I let go of Katara?

18:08.055 --> 18:10.391
I... I love her.

18:10.516 --> 18:12.559
Learn to let her go,

18:12.685 --> 18:15.271
or you cannot let the pure cosmic energy

18:15.396 --> 18:17.690
flow in from the universe.

18:17.815 --> 18:20.442
Why would I choose
cosmic energy over Katara?

18:20.567 --> 18:23.445
How could it be a bad thing that
I feel an attachment to her?

18:23.529 --> 18:25.614
Three chakras ago,
that was a good thing.

18:25.698 --> 18:28.409
You must learn to let go.

18:30.703 --> 18:32.538
( PANTING )

18:32.621 --> 18:34.248
Thank goodness you're here, Suki.

18:34.331 --> 18:35.958
Something terrible
is going on.

18:36.041 --> 18:37.960
The Fire Nation has
infiltrated the city.

18:38.043 --> 18:40.129
I just saw Prince Zuko
and his uncle!

18:40.462 --> 18:42.423
We have to tell
the Earth King right away!

18:42.548 --> 18:46.051
Oh, don't worry.
I'll be sure to let him know.

18:46.427 --> 18:48.095
( SCREECHES )

18:50.472 --> 18:51.557
( GASPS )

18:52.266 --> 18:53.475
( GRUNTS )

18:54.810 --> 18:57.271
AZULA: So, Zu Zu's in the city, too.

18:57.813 --> 19:00.649
I think it's time
for a family reunion.

19:01.233 --> 19:02.234
( CHATTERING )

19:02.943 --> 19:05.446
I'm sorry, but I can't
let go of Katara.

19:05.571 --> 19:08.699
Aang, to master the Avatar State,

19:08.824 --> 19:11.952
you must open
all the chakras.

19:12.077 --> 19:13.787
Surrender yourself.

19:13.912 --> 19:15.998
Okay, I'll try.

19:20.919 --> 19:25.674
GURU: Now, think of your attachments
and let them go.

19:25.799 --> 19:29.303
Let the pure cosmic energy flow.

19:54.870 --> 19:57.164
( KATARA SCREAMING )

19:57.289 --> 19:59.750
Let me go! ( STRAINING )

20:05.714 --> 20:07.049
( PANTING )

20:12.429 --> 20:14.431
( SCREAMING )

20:15.641 --> 20:18.185
Katara is in danger!
I have to go!

20:18.310 --> 20:19.895
No, Aang!

20:20.020 --> 20:23.023
By choosing attachment,
you have locked the chakra!

20:23.148 --> 20:27.361
If you leave now, you won't be able
to go into the Avatar State at all!

20:37.121 --> 20:38.831
( METAL CLANGS )

20:40.624 --> 20:42.292
It's another one of her tricks.

20:42.584 --> 20:44.461
There's a giant hole in the box.

20:44.586 --> 20:45.712
How is that a trick?

20:45.838 --> 20:48.715
It's not! It's the real deal!

20:58.392 --> 21:00.811
I am the greatest
Earthbender in the world!

21:00.936 --> 21:03.564
Don't you two dunderheads
ever forget!

21:13.490 --> 21:17.870
I'm going to be stuck in here
forever with you, aren't I?

21:18.412 --> 21:20.622
I have to go to the bathroom.

21:20.706 --> 21:22.207
( METAL CLANGS )

21:23.041 --> 21:25.711
Ready to go knock
some Fire Nation heads?

21:25.794 --> 21:28.172
You don't know how much
this means to me, Dad.

21:28.255 --> 21:29.381
I'll make you proud,

21:29.465 --> 21:32.134
and I'll finally prove to you
what a great warrior I am.

21:32.217 --> 21:35.262
Sokka, you don't have
to prove anything to me.

21:35.387 --> 21:37.055
I'm already proud of you,

21:37.181 --> 21:39.641
and I've always known
you were a great warrior.

21:39.933 --> 21:41.143
Really?

21:41.226 --> 21:44.605
Why do you think I trusted you
to look after our tribe when I left?

21:56.366 --> 21:57.743
This can't be good news.

22:08.921 --> 22:10.130
What is this about?

22:10.214 --> 22:13.467
Your agents show up in the middle
of the night and drag me down here?

22:13.550 --> 22:15.802
You will not treat
a Kyoshi Warrior this way!

22:16.094 --> 22:19.515
But you are not
a Kyoshi Warrior, are you,

22:19.598 --> 22:22.059
Princess Azula of the Fire Nation?

22:22.142 --> 22:24.895
- What do you want?
- I want to make a deal.

22:24.978 --> 22:28.190
It's time that I regain
control of Ba Sing Se,

22:28.315 --> 22:30.692
and you have
something I need.

22:31.235 --> 22:34.029
- Oh?
- The Earth King's trust.

22:34.154 --> 22:36.073
Why should I help you?

22:36.198 --> 22:39.451
Because I can get you the Avatar.

22:39.993 --> 22:41.119
I'm listening.

22:47.209 --> 22:48.752
A message from the royal palace.

22:51.505 --> 22:54.591
I... I can't believe it.

22:54.716 --> 22:58.136
- What is it, Uncle?
- Great news!

22:58.262 --> 23:03.225
We've been invited to serve
tea to the Earth King!

23:08.981 --> 23:10.357
( METAL DOOR SLAMS )
